________________________________NOTE__________________________________

These cracks are intended for people with the retail version who don't want to have to insert the CD everytime they play, if you don't have the retail and are trying to install the update you may well have problems, I've included a reg file which may help with installing the upgrade (chances are the path will need to be manually changed).


